--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

2. Lucide Icons

   Copyright (c) for portions of Lucide are held by Cole Bemis 2013-2022
   as part of Feather (MIT). All other copyright (c) for Lucide are held by
   Lucide Contributors 2022.
   License: ISC License
   Source:  https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
   Full license text: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide/blob/main/LICENSE

   Usage in HBP:
   SVG path data is inlined directly into admin templates (core/admin_views/*.tpl.php)
   for icon rendering. No external file or font is loaded at runtime.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

3. marked.js (optional / CDN only)

   Copyright (c) 2011-2023, Christopher Jeffrey (https://github.com/chjj)
   License: MIT License
   Source:  https://github.com/markedjs/marked
   Full license text: https://github.com/markedjs/marked/blob/master/LICENSE.md

   Usage in HBP:
   Optionally loaded via CDN in the admin Markdown editor for live preview only.
   Not bundled; not used in the public-facing theme.

